(7585092, 1219699, 181335, '<td valign="top">Appreciate your comments,Mr.Tate, It''s was my first intention to read such a message as under water. A poor man that keeping his  mouth hitting against the floor to attract the people passing by. the percentage of giving money to the metal bowl are as high as 25%. Guangzhou GDP is higher than whole of Russia. I only see this images in this area for more than 2 weeks here. It''s getting much lesser and lesser compare 10 years ago.!</td>', 'Appreciate your comments,Mr.Tate, It''s was my first intention to read such a message as under water. A poor man that keeping his  mouth hitting against the floor to attract the people passing by. the percentage of giving money to the metal bowl are as high as 25%. Guangzhou GDP is higher than whole of Russia. I only see this images in this area for more than 2 weeks here. It''s getting much lesser and lesser compare 10 years ago.!', '2018-07-23 14:40:57.000000', NULL, 0);
